# Route: guide 10 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 30 to
# 33, 51 quests, 4.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Wetlands, Dun Morogh): Menethil Harbor -> Bluegill Marsh -> Sundown
# Marsh -> Black Channel Marsh -> Menethil Harbor -> Bluegill Marsh ->
# Menethil Harbor -> Thelgen Rock -> Angerfang Encampment -> The Green Belt ->
# Mosshide Fen -> Thelgen Rock -> The Green Belt -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Death to the Dragonmaw (98291;
# Dragonmaw Reclaimer 30, Dragonmaw Soulbinder, Dragonmaw Infiltrator); Defeat
# Nek'rosh (474; Chieftain Nek'rosh 32).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 95217 The
# Quarry's Smith; 96031 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 96044 Camping 101:
# Blacksmithing; 96046 Camping 101: Mining; 96047 Camping 101: First Aid;
# 96050 Camping 101: Fishing; 96055 Camping 101: Herbalism; 96056 Camping 101:
# Skinning; 96057 Camping 101: Tailoring; 96058 Camping 101: Engineering.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Fury Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost
# in the Thicket Things (95647), Fallen in the Fen (95795), Heartwoven
# (95809), Highland Hides (98815), Highland Hides (98815), Prehistoric Prism
# (98824), Prehistoric Prism (98824), A Fine Mess (2904), The Sparklematic
# 5200! (2951), The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), The Only Cure is More
# Green Glow (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126), Old Ironforge Incursion
# (96393), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393).

